OL,3,ARussian military plane crashes killing
OL,4,Aall 19 on board
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Russian military transport plane has
OL,7,Fcrashed in Siberia, killing all 19
OL,8,Fpeople on board, the country's defence
OL,9,Fministry is cited as saying by
OL,10,Fstate-run media.
OL,12,FThe An-12 aircraft went down during a
OL,13,F"scheduled flight" in an "uninhabited
OL,14,Farea" in the Kemerovo region, the
OL,15,Fministry said in a statement.
OL,17,FA technical malfunction is
OL,18,Fpreliminarily believed to be the cause
OL,19,Fof Tuesday's crash, the ministry added.
OL,20,FAn investigation by Russia's aviation
OL,21,Fauthorities is now under way.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
