OL,3,ARussian military plane crashes killing
OL,4,Aall 19 on board
OL,5,
OL,6,FLocal Governor Ilya Seredyuk said an
OL,7,Femergency response team "quickly
OL,8,Fextinguished a blaze" after the crash
OL,9,Fnear the village of Yagunovo, and the
OL,10,Farea was sealed off by police.
